        sort_time: "2026-12-05 11:00:00",
        end_time_formatted: "2026-12-05 18:00",
        detail: "The most wonderful time of the year is almost here, and we’re kicking off the holiday season with a little Christmas magic, a lot of laughter, and plenty of holiday cheer! ❤️\nOur vineyard elves will be busy decking the halls December 1st-4th, transforming the tasting room into a festive wonderland. And trust us… you won’t want to miss what they’ve been up to! 🎁✨\n🎄 Here’s what’s brewing for our holiday celebration!\n🍷 A Little Wassailing Magic! Our secret wassailing recipe, guaranteed to warm your spirits and get you feeling merry!\n🎶 Christmas Carols & Holiday Cheer! Bunny and Arvie Bennett Jr. will fill the tasting room with the sounds of the season from 2-5 PM.\n🎅 Ugly Sweater Contest! Dig deep into those closets, pull out your most outrageous, over-the-top Christmas sweater, and come ready to show it off! We’ll have some fun and games along the way, with winners crowned at 4:30 PM! 🏆\n🍽️ Holiday Goodies! Bistro Betty will be serving up delicious food and festive flavors from 11 AM-5 PM.\n🍷 Wine, Wine & More Wine! Our merry little elves behind the bar will be pouring your favorite Souther Williams wines all day long. And while you’re here, why not check a few names off your Christmas list with a bottle or two of locally grown holiday cheer? 🎁\n✨ Five years of wassailing, ugly sweaters, laughter, and holiday memories! There’s something special about celebrating the season with friends, old and new, right here where the mountains meet the vines.\n21+ Venue -",
