        detail: "The Winter Dance Performance showcases the talented dancers from the SC Governor\'s School for the Arts and Humanities. This year\'s program features classical excerpts from Nutcracker and Giselle, as well as innovative jazz and contemporary works choreographed by SCGSAH faculty Uriah Boyd, Josee Garant, Katie Stewart, and Brandon Welch.",
        location: "Peace Center SW corner of Broad St. and Main St. Downtown Greenville, South Carolina",
