        name: `QUEST: An All-Star Exploration of Modern Jazz`,
        sort_time: "2026-12-30 19:00:00",
        end_time_formatted: "2026-12-30 23:59",
        detail: "QUEST: An All-Star Exploration of Modern Jazz Wed, Dec 30 Quest. An exploration of music and artistic expression through new and well-worn compositions, solo and group improvisations, and statements of adventure, sorrow, celebration, and jealousy. \n \n Welcome to a new journey through the page and into the collective ambitions of four extraordinary musicians. Bringing together their unique musical backgrounds and influences, Quest is a brand-new endeavor rooted in artistic expression, spontaneous improvisation, and the possibilities of creating something together. \n \n Brought to you by an exceptional lineup of musicians whose work spans Grammy Award-winning ensembles, acclaimed jazz projects, and international stages: \n \n Justin Stanton - Keyboard (Snarky Puppy) \n Quinn Sternberg - Bass (Mind Beach, Charlie Ballentine) \n Jaze Uries - Drums (Okonski, Get Right Band) \n Jacob Rodriguez - Saxophone (The Core, Michael Bublé) \n \n Join us at Hotel Eve for an evening of adventurous musicianship, inspired improvisation, and a new journey into the unexpected. \n \n Tickets & Seating \n $15 Advance: Claim your preferred table here and enjoy guaranteed seating! \n Feeling spontaneous? Risk it at the door! (Subject to availability) \n Pay What You Can Option for Local Musicians: Available exclusively at the door as general admission. \n \n See you there! \n Read More 07:00 PM SHOW 08:30 PM SHOW",
